      "content": "That's quite intense. To make this more useful for the students, can you flesh out the specific arguments regarding why they believed these populations were \"incapable\" of ruling themselves? Maybe expand on the distinctions they made between \"civilized\" law and the \"primitive\" systems they encountered, and how they viewed the natural hierarchy of different races at the time.",
