      "content": "Interesting. For the curriculum, I want to make sure the students can see the scientific side of how they justified this. Could you elaborate on how those 19th-century administrators used the \"science\" of the time—like things like cranial measurements or theories of social Darwinism—to prove those points about biological hierarchy and the necessity of imperial rule?",
